{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X对人物心理动机和情绪转折的因果交代不如Y完整，尤其S05—S09，部分心理变化需要观众自行补足。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、关键词加亮和感受词分层出现，更适合边听音乐边扫屏幕，观众能迅速抓住每段的情绪落点，也能跟着音乐变化感受到细微的起伏。Y的优势是把人物为什么犹豫、为什么害怕、为什么改变讲得更完整，前后心理因果也更连贯；但长句在短停留时间内阅读负担较大。综合来看，X更适合音乐视频的即时观看体验，Y更像一段完整、易懂的心理叙事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e2a567c0-934a-49c8-bcf3-6347e885a4e6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T224639347500Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.063, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:47:50.415101+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ef300c10796cdf5dc8e55b2610a17533f67bd12bcca21d131eca598292a46fa4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eed